    "name": "SenaiStock API - Complete Test Collection",
    "description": "Comprehensive test collection for SenaiStock API\n\nCRITICAL TESTS:\n- 🔴 Saida blocks when quantity > available stock (HTTP 422)\n- 🔴 Saida requires justification (HTTP 422 if missing)\n- 🔴 Stock never goes negative\n- 🔴 Entrada always permitted (never fails with valid data)\n- 🔴 ISBN must be unique",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
